# Test output artifacts. All test output goes to Binaries/Release/test_output/
# (covered by Binaries/ above). These rules are a defensive backstop in case a
# test still writes into the source tree. The one exception is
# source/tests/data/reference/ — committed reference anchors are intentionally
# tracked and must NOT be ignored.
source/tests/data/output/
**/tests/output/
**/tests/data/output/
*.test_output.png

